@startuml
' Attachment mapping for CZ K-ORDER
hide circle
hide stereotype
hide members
hide methods
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam class {
BackgroundColor<<LogicalModel>> #APPLICATION
BackgroundColor<<Profile>> #TECHNOLOGY
}
legend right
| <#APPLICATION>  Logický model |
| <#TECHNOLOGY>  Profil |
endlegend
class "Vizuální podoba dokumentu" as PresentedForm <<LogicalModel>> [[StructureDefinition-logPresentedFormCz.html]]
class "Přílohy" as Attachments <<LogicalModel>> [[StructureDefinition-logAttachmentsCz.html]]
PresentedForm -d[hidden]-> Attachments
class "KOrderCompositionCz" as Target0 <<Profile>> [[StructureDefinition-KOrderCompositionCz.html]]
PresentedForm <|. Target0
class "CZ_Attachment" as Target1 <<Profile>> [[https://hl7.cz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-cz-attachment.html]]
Attachments <|. Target1
Target0 -d[hidden]-> Target1
@enduml
